{"id":"6e2653d41c62cb0e","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-quantifier-free.md","title":"Quantifier-Free Formula","display":"df-quantifier-free — Quantifier-Free Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-quantifier-free","aliases":["57-df-quantifier-free","df-quantifier-free — Quantifier-Free Formula"],"display":"df-quantifier-free — Quantifier-Free Formula","depends_on":["[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-quantifier-rank]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-quantifier-free"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-quantifier-free</span><span>df-quantifier-free — Quantifier-Free Formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-free — Quantifier-Free Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c712d26a957f90f\" href=\"?note=6c712d26a957f90f\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-rank\">57-df-quantifier-rank</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}free} \\vdash \\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi) \\; \\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi) = 0\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quantifier\\text{-}free} \\vdash \\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi) \\; \\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi) = 0\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QF}_S\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{QFree}(\\varphi)\\)</span> : 谓词，表示公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是量词自由的（无量词）</li>\n<li>量词自由公式即量词秩为 0 的公式，只包含原子公式和布尔连接词</li>\n<li>量词自由公式在以下上下文中特别重要：\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0df613e30f0e3f59\" href=\"?note=0df613e30f0e3f59\" title=\"57-thm-presburger-decidable\">57-thm-presburger-decidable</a>: Presburger 算术的量词消除</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5d65b2fd44760f8\" href=\"?note=d5d65b2fd44760f8\" title=\"57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination\">57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination</a>: 实闭域的量词消除</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a8141676f191f64\" href=\"?note=5a8141676f191f64\" title=\"57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a>: 算术层级的定义基础</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748"