cations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 见 [[57-df-S-ar]]，$\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$、$\\mathrm{QFree}$、$\\mathrm{Var}$ 见 [[57-df-formula]]、[[57-df-quantifier-free]]、[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。本文件的 $\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0$ 是**原始语法公式集合**，保留量词自由的初层，不是自然数集合的类。$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$，变量块长度允许零；$\\exists\\vec x\\varphi$ 和 $\\forall\\vec x\\varphi$ 按所列顺序逐个构造量词，空块返回原公式。"},{"id":"b1739a7dc0b811d9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle\\in(\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\times\\mathrm{Var})^n$；$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$\\mathrm{QFree}(\\psi)$，见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。$\\varphi=\\mathrm{Pref}(\\langle(Q_1,x_1),\\ldots,(Q_n,x_n)\\rangle,\\psi)$，$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 取 [[57-df-prenex]]。这里读取当前语法树的完整量词前缀，不任意选择一个与 φ 等价的前束公式；空前缀和重复绑定变量均保留。"},{"id":"341dd891eed2b080","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c26c22b49d5bbbe4","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$、$\\mathrm{Var}$、公式构造子见 [[57-df-formula]]；$\\mathrm{QFree}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$\\vec q$ 是有限量词—变量对列。$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 按列长递归。"},{"id":"a9a7faa02ecae403","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$；$\\mathrm{QFree}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]，有限全称前缀函数 $\\mathrm{All}$ 见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。"},{"id":"43ca2d9b7fc5df00","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8ad50b1bb4a4cb1","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 是有效的有限纯关系语言：无常量、正元函数及零元关系符号；允许逻辑等号。$g$ 是 [[57-df-godel-numbering]] 的有效语法编码，$\\mathrm{EffGN}(g,S)$。$\\mathrm{Pref}$ 取 [[57-df-prenex]]，$\\mathrm{QF}_S$ 取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}(\\{\\sigma\\})$ 是该单句的可满足性。$\\mathrm{Dec}_{\\mathbb N}$ 是数集可判定类，不是 [[57-df-decidable-theory]] 的理论类 Dec；其与 $\\mathrm{Rec}$ 的关系在下式明示。"},{"id":"71233b52551503c6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_<}$；$\\mathrm{QF}_{S_<}$ 见 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。固定变量 $z$。由于纯序语言没有闭项或原始真值常量，允许消去后用 $z\\doteq z$ 或 $\\neg(z\\doteq z)$ 表达恒真或恒假，故允许这个辅助自由变量。$\\models$ 对开公式使用全称赋值语义。"},{"id":"c00621aad56d26fb","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0df613e30f0e3f59","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 的非逻辑符号为 $0,1,+,<$，依次为两个常量、二元函数和二元关系；$\\mathfrak N_+$ 为载体 $\\mathbb N$ 上解释为通常 $0,1,+,<$ 的结构。$S^\\equiv$ 再加入互异二元关系符号 $\\equiv_d$（$d\\ge2$）；$\\mathfrak N_+^\\equiv$ 的新关系由下式定义。各语言使用完成字母表视图，其未列出的非逻辑分区为空。$g$ 为该可数有效语言的有效编码；$\\mathrm{Dec}$ 使用标准 Hilbert 演算，$\\mathrm{QFree}$ 取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]。$\\mathrm{Th}(\\mathbb N,+,0,1,<)$ 及其带同余符号写法分别是这两个标准结构理论的兼容记号。"},{"id":"617923ff5edce923","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5d65b2fd44760f8","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}$ 保持 [[57-df-field]] 的原语言（其中没有 $<$）；$S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^<$ 是其加入一个新二元关系符号 $<$ 的扩展，其他符号分区保持不变。$\\mathfrak R$ 是环语言结构，$<_R\\subseteq R^2$，$R=|\\mathfrak R|$；$\\mathfrak R^<$ 为把 $<$ 解释为 $<_R$ 的同载体扩张。$\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}$ 取 [[57-df-rcf]]，不把原 $\\mathrm{RCF}$ 谓词替换成它。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^<}$；$\\mathrm{QF}$ 与满足取 [[57-df-quantifier-free]]、[[57-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-quantifier-free]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[